    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
      <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
            <p xml:id="Aink445-kilavi">pācaraikkaṇ irunta talaimakaṉ paruva varaviṉkaṇ talaimakaḷai niṉaintu neñcoṭu pulantu colliyatu.</p>
            <p xml:lang="en">The hero, who was in the warcamp, at the coming of the season [of his intended return], thinking of the heroine, grew vexed with his heart and spoke [this].</p>
              </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
          <lg xml:id="Aink445">        
            <l>pukaḻcāl ciṟappiṟ kātali pulampat</l>
            <l>tuṟantuvan taṉaiyē yaruntoḻiṟ kaṭṭūr</l>
            <l>nallēṟu taḻīi nākupeyar kālai</l>
            <l>yuḷḷutoṟuṅ kaliḻu neñcam</l>
            <l>vallē yemmaiyum varaviḻait taṉaiyē.</l>
        </lg>  
 <lg xml:lang="en">                    
<l>So that the beloved of praiseworthy excellence grieves,</l>
<l>you abandoned [her] and came. To the warcamp of the difficult task,</l>
<l>O heart that cries whenever it thinks of</l>
<l>the time the good bull and the cow embraced and left [together],</l>
<l>you made me come quickly as well.</l> 
</lg>                      
        </div>
      </body>
    </text>
